==Battleground==
*10 [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Celeboodle]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[J.K. Bun Bun]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Kroxo]]s spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**5 [[Helmut Krabbe]]s spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**3 [[Cyberhorn]]s spawn, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
**1 [[I.M. Phace]] spawns.
**15 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
It is recommended to at least gather all the Superior [[Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures|Unstarred-Alien Treasures]] from both [[Into the Future|Into The Future]] chapters One and Two. Even then, the enemies can push quite hard so bring at least 3-4 meatshields to this fight.

Start off by stalling the initial peons for cash and begin stacking debuffer units. [[Witch Cat (Rare Cat)|Sorceress Cat]], [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Dancing Flasher Cat]], and [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|iCat]] work for the Red enemies (Even better if you have their [[True Form|True Forms]]), while [[Psychocat (Rare Cat)|Neo Psychocat]] and [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Castaway]] can hold off the Aliens. For general attackers, [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] can deal great damage and can remove the Red enemies from this universe. Keep a solid stack of [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cats]] and backliners of your choosing and the stage is yours.

